# Bot2's Lightning Bolt (mana value 1) is on the stack aimed at Bot1 when Bot1 answers with Divide by Zero (Black Lotus
# pays): a spell is a legal target (CR 115.1), the Bolt goes back to its owner's hand without being countered (CR 400.3) and
# Bot1 keeps their life. Learn (CR 701.48a): Bot1 discards nothing and reveals Firebending Lesson from the sideboard,
# which goes to their hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Divide by Zero
Island x5
Island x10

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Firebending Lesson

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Divide by Zero.Cast(Stack.Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
Bot1.Choose(Firebending Lesson)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Sideboard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Firebending Lesson.Colors.Count = 1
